  "description": "ASP.NET Core authentication schemes for AuthService-issued credentials: AddConciergeJwtBearer verifies human JWTs (RS256/JWKS via Concierge.Auth.Client.Keys' IJwksKeyProvider, then a MANDATORY Redis jti deny-list check — contract §3.4, §5) and AddConciergeApiKey validates presented API keys against a host-supplied loader. Also covers the WebSocket handshake (§7). The only Concierge.Auth.Client.* package that references ASP.NET Core or StackExchange.Redis.",
